        "description": "Phase 1 of the Kamata–Keikyū-Kamata link (~0.8 km of new line plus the underground approach from the Tōkyū Tamagawa Line). Plan certified by MLIT on 2025-10-03 (Haneda Airport Line Co. builds, Tōkyū operates; through service from the Tamagawa Line, some trains from the Tōyoko Line). Surveys and design started 2026; construction not yet started. Opening target 'early Reiwa 20s' (2038-2042), shown as 2040; works run to March 2042. Phase 2 (towards Haneda over the Keikyū Airport Line, different gauge) is still a study. Alignment and the underground Kamata / Keikyū Kamata stations are approximate. Colour is not official."
